testdata/optional_widening/cast.a:3:15: Adamic 0.1 refuses an unproven relation from { x: number; } to { x: number; y?: number; }: optional field y has no proven compatible presence/type; keep compatible optional fields in both views, or construct an object with explicitly compatible fields (adamic/no-optional-widening); use a proven upcast, narrow a discriminated union by its tag (`if (shape.kind !== 'Circle') panic('why')`), downcast along nominal class ancestry, or move the file to `.ts`, where a member cast is checked (adamic/no-unchecked-cast)
